<div class="wikven-home-section">
<translate>
<!--T:14-->
== Where it fits ==
</translate>
<div class="wikven-home-fits">
<translate>
<!--T:22-->
A project's documentation, an archived wiki, a personal wiki. Unlike a general static-site generator such as
[<tvar name="1">https://gohugo.io/</tvar> Hugo] or [<tvar name="2">https://www.mkdocs.org/</tvar> MkDocs], {{SITENAME}} renders real wikitext, so it suits content
that is already a wiki. See [[<tvar name="3">Special:MyLanguage/Why wikitext</tvar>|Why wikitext]] for how the markup compares with
Markdown, and [[<tvar name="4">Special:MyLanguage/Limitations</tvar>|Limitations]] for what a live wiki does that a published site cannot.
</translate>
</div>
</div>

